---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Refund Policy — Penida-Go" description="Cancellation and refund policies for Penida-Go transfers.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>We understand that travel itineraries can change unexpectedly due to weather, ferry schedules, or flight adjustments.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Free Rescheduling</h2>
      <p>You can reschedule your private car transfer or island tour up to 12 hours prior to scheduled departure at no extra cost.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Weather Cancellations</h2>
      <p>If ferry or fast boat operations between Sanur and Nusa Penida are halted by harbor authorities due to severe ocean conditions, 100% full refund or date exchange applies immediately.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
